// Scripted cutscene Hor+ correction (danyole7)
// 0x001B3AFC loads this cutscene-only numerator. The original 524.339966
// is multiplied by 20/27; the denominator at 0x00440FC4 is unchanged.
// The hook replaces the branch at 0x001B3B14, retaining its original delay
// slot (swc1 f0,8(s0)). It sets only this scripted camera's virtual height
// to 360 * 20/27 = 266.666667, then marks projection data dirty.
// Scaling lens and height together preserves vertical FOV and adds 35%
// horizontal coverage relative to 16:9. Animated lens changes are retained.
